SUMMARY:Upper Strength + Calisthenics Pull
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3350 kcal\, 175 g protein\, 455 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 35-45 g protein in 4 meals\, 40-70 g carbs before 
 lifting\, and a protein-plus-carb meal after training.\nCategory: gym\nRu
 n volume: 0 km\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-7 min easy bike\, band pull-aparts\, scap
  push-ups\, and 2 bench ramp sets.\n\nMain Work:\n- Progression: double p
 rogression\; add load only after all sets reach the top of the range at R
 PE 8 or lower\, about 2 RIR.\n- Bench press: top set 1 x 4-6 at RPE 8\, t
 hen 3 back-off sets x 5-7 at RPE 7-8.\n- Pull-ups: 4 x 4-8 at RPE 8 paire
 d with chest-supported row 4 x 8-12 at RPE 8.\n- Overhead press or Arnold
  press: 3 x 6-10 at RPE 8 paired with incline dumbbell press or dumbbell 
 press 2 x 8-10 at RPE 8.\n- Shoulder and arm finisher: lateral raises 3 x
  12-20 at RPE 8 plus farmer carries 4 x 30-40 m\, preacher curls or hamme
 r curls 2 x 10-15\, and reverse curls 2 x 12-15.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily
  macros\, keep protein near target\, and place carbohydrates before and a
 fter training.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobil
 ity if joints feel stiff.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
