 35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: easy_run\nRun volume: 5 km\nAdj
 ustments:\n- Adjusted for schedule constraints.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-10 min e
 asy movement\, joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp sets before loading.\n\n
 Main Work:\n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 5 km at conversational effort\; cadence l
 ight and relaxed.\n\nOptional:\n- 20-30 min walk later if knees feel norm
 al.\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 5 km.\n\nFueling:\n- fruit or rye 
 bread plus caffeine is enough before a short morning run.\n\nRecovery:\n-
  8-10 min hips\, quads\, calves\, and ankles.
