SUMMARY:Lower Strength + Knee Capacity
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3500 kcal\, 180 g protein\, 505 g carbs\, 1
 00 g fat\nMacro timing: hit the higher protein target with 40-45 g protei
 n in 4 meals\, plus 50-80 g carbs before heavy lifting and carbs again af
 ter.\nCategory: gym\nRun volume: 0 km\nAdjustments:\n- Adjusted for sched
 ule constraints.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 7-8 min bike\, ankle rocks\, bodyweight s
 quats\, and short-foot activation.\n\nMain Work:\n- Progression: double p
 rogression\; add load only when knee tracking stays clean\, discomfort st
 ays 0-2/10\, and top sets stay near RPE 8.\n- Hack squat or goblet squat:
  top set 1 x 6-8 at RPE 8\, then 3 back-off sets x 8-10 at RPE 7-8.\n- Ro
 manian deadlift: 4 x 6-8 at RPE 7-8 with controlled eccentrics.\n- Leg ex
 tension: 3 x 12-15 at RPE 8 paired with front-foot elevated split squat 2
 -3 x 8-10 per leg at RPE 7.\n- Core finisher: seated calf raise plus tibi
 alis raises 4 x 12-20 each at RPE 7\, then side plank 2 x 30 sec.\n\nFuel
 ing:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and place carbohydr
 ates before and after training.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-
 06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.
